# Safety and Privacy Rule

Read docs/SAFETY_POLICY.md before changing safety-related features or copy.

Never:
- Guarantee safety.
- Claim emergency services were contacted.
- Impersonate police, dispatch, MARTA, employers, or real people.
- Diagnose medical or mental-health conditions.
- Expose precise rider locations, home addresses, phone numbers, legal names, or contact information.
- Let an LLM determine whether to call emergency services.

When immediate danger is mentioned:
- Tell the user to call 911.
- Link or route to the Safety Hub.
- Keep language direct and calm.
- Do not promise that the app will intervene.

Use aliases, route names, station zones, and broad time windows in buddy matching.

All generated audio must be labeled as comfort audio or guided support.
